meta {
  name: Share Quote All
  type: http
  seq: 35
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/share-quote-all
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "recipientType": "PATIENT",
    "email": "patient@example.com",
    "whatsapp": "919999999999"
  }
}

docs {
  Resend the lab quotation over Email + WhatsApp to the patient AND the referral
  panel together, and raise the in-app (IAM) notification, in one call.

  - `recipientType` (PATIENT default) — which recipient the `email`/`whatsapp`
    overrides apply to; the OTHER recipient uses its stored contacts.
  - IAM targets the order creator + referral parties (internal-referral employee),
    NOT the patient (panels/external referrals have no in-app user).

  Per-channel outcomes are collapsed to one result per channel (QUEUED if either
  recipient queued). Returns `{ orderId, results: [{ channel, status, reason?, logId? }] }`.
  The quotation PDF is rendered once and reused. Prereqs: activated
  `lab_quotation_as_attachment` templates (Email/WhatsApp/IAM) + an active
  `lab_quotation_print` PDF template.
}
